# Section scratch: preview scaffolding and rendered probe output.
#
# WHY THIS BLOCK EXISTS. Each section is built and looked at in isolation before
# it is composed, and the scaffolding that does it lands beside the component: a
# preview entry, a build script, and a directory of rendered output. Six of those
# were still in the tree on 2026-09-04 — one of them a whole copy of a built
# site, _headers and favicons included, at 77 KB — and were removed.
#
# THE LINE THESE PATTERNS DRAW, because "starts with an underscore" is not it.
# A section's directory holds two different kinds of extra file, and only one is
# disposable:
#
#   Disposable — PREVIEW SCAFFOLDING AND RENDERED OUTPUT. A `__preview/` entry
#   and its build script, a `__preview.html`, a `__probe-out/` of rendered
#   files. These are how a section was looked at once. Ignored below.
#
#   NOT disposable — VERIFICATION SCRIPTS. `__probe.mjs`, `__probe-entry.tsx`,
#   `__gen.mjs`, `__serve.mjs`, and the `_out/` and `_verify/` directories,
#   which despite their names hold `verify.mjs` and `render-check.mjs` rather
#   than output. Section docstrings cite these BY NAME as the re-runnable check
#   behind a claim — src/sections/risks-register/entries.tsx and
#   RisksRegister.tsx cite `__probe.mjs`, agents-reference-client/copy.ts cites
#   `./_out/verify.mjs`, faq-questions/copy.ts cites `_verify/verify.mjs`. A
#   file a comment tells a reader to run has to be a file the repository
#   carries, so none of them is ignored and none was removed.
#
# The patterns match the shape rather than the six names, because the next
# preview directory will be called something else.
__preview*
__probe-out/

# Reference screenshots. Regenerated from a served dist/, not authored.
screenshots/

